  "description": {
   "en": "An anthology of love stories.\n\n+++**Volume 1:**\n1. *Days Wishes Fall* [소원이 내리는 나날, Sowoni Naerineun Nanal] by Yun Ji Woon\nAbout the relationship between a father and a daughter.\n2. *The Door* [문, Mun] by Kim Yeon-Joo\nThe reminisces of a girl in the temporary care of a lord apparent.\n3. *The Ravages of the Tiger* [호환, Hohwan] by SeoMoon Da-Mi\nA girl seeks revenge and death through hunting a tiger.\n4. *The Night Has a Thousand Eyes* [밤은 천 개의 눈을 가지고 있다, Bameun Cheon Gaeui Nuneul Gajigo Itda] by Lee Hyeon-Sook\nThe relationship between a boy, his girlfriend, and her cousin.\n5. *I Hate You, Dad ♡* [아빠 미워♡, Appa Miwo♡] by Lee Si Young\n6. *The Road the Dead Pass by* [망자(亡者)가 지나는 길, Mangjaga Jinaneun Gil] by Park Eun-Ah\n+++\n+++**Volume 2:** \"Boy's Love\"\n1. Dalbameun Wiheomcheonman! [달밤은 위험천만!] by Shim Hye-Jin\n2. *Get Real* by Na Yeri\n3. *To Be Born in an Endless Night* [끝없는 밤에 태어나다, Kkeuteomneun Bame Taeeonada] by Lee Hyeon-Sook\n4. *Jardin de chouette* [올빼미의 정원] by Kang Hye-Jin\n5. *But...* [그러나…, Geureona…] by Lee Si Young\n6. *Lunch* by Shin Yoo Ha (신유하)\n7. *Sanctuary* [성역] by Rhim Ju-Yeon\n+++\n+++**Volume 3:** \"Antiq + Sad\"\n1. *Moon Palace* [월궁 (月宮), Wolgung] by Yun Ji Woon\n2. *Secret* [비밀 (悲謐), Bimil] by Kang Hye-Jin (강혜진)\n3. *And...* [그리고..., Geurigo...] by Lee Si Young\n4. *Sorrow* [哀 (슬플애), Seulpeul-ae] by Park Ki-Hong and Kim Seon Hee\n5. *Hijo de la luna* [이호델라루나 (달의 아들), Hijo de la luna (Darui Adeul)] by Shin Ji-Sang and Geo\nA nobleman recalls the tragic story of a boy born out of wedlock and the supposed curse upon him because of his white eye. The cursed boy lives a harsh life and falls in love with someone forbidden to him. In the end the beast kills the one he cared most about.\n+++\n+++**Volume 4:** \"Older\"\n1. *Shepherds* [염소 치는 사람들, Yeomso Chineun Saramdeul] by Kwon Gyo-jung\n2. *Bride* [신부, Sinbu] by Aivan\n3. Hwanggeumnaseonui Gyeongno [황금나선의 경로] by Yoo Shi Jin\n4. *Sweet and Sweet* [달콤하고 달콤하도다, Dalkomhago Dalkomhadoda] by Kim Se-Young\n5. Neoneun Naui Dalbit [너는 나의 달빛] by Lee Si Young\n6. *1000 Years in Your Eyes* [천년도 당신 눈에는, Cheonnyeondo Dangsin Nuneneun] by Rhim Ju-Yeon\n+++"
  },
